sequenceDiagram
    %% two people in one co-editing room
    actor ana as Ana
    actor ben as Ben
    participant room as Room
    participant engine as Engine
    ana->>room: join with a session cookie
    room-->>ana: full state
    ben->>room: join
    room-->>ben: full state
    loop while typing
        ana-)room: yjs update
        room-)ben: yjs update
    end
    ben-)room: awareness
    room-)ana: awareness
    room->>+engine: save live text
    engine->>engine: merge with the last saved state
    engine-->>-room: saved
